## 📈 Business Questions Solved

- Count the total number of users.
- Count the total number of orders.
- Find users from a particular city.
- Display products ordered by price.
- Count users by city.
- Find the number of orders by status.
- Calculate total revenue.
- Calculate average order value.
- Display customer order details using JOINs.
- Find the top-selling products.
- Calculate revenue generated by each product.
- Find the average review rating.
- Identify customers whose spending is above the average customer spending.
- Create a view for customer order summaries.
- Create indexes to improve query performance.

